  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/11/IMG_1199.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">(48 fotos) Aquest dissabte han comen&ccedil;at els XXXIV Jocs Escolars Esportius, organitzats per la Caixa Rural d&#39;Onda</span><span style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">, l&#39;Ajuntament i les AMPA, amb la primera jornada de les competicions de futbol sala.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jocsescolarsesportiusprimerajornada17/img_1194.jpg\" alt=\"img_1194\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jocsescolarsesportiusprimerajornada17/img_1195.jpg\" alt=\"img_1195\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jocsescolarsesportiusprimerajornada17/img_1197.jpg\" alt=\"img_1197\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jocsescolarsesportiusprimerajornada17/img_1199.jpg\" alt=\"img_1199\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jocsescolarsesportiusprimerajornada17/img_1201.jpg\" alt=\"img_1201\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jocsescolarsesportiusprimerajornada17/img_1202.jpg\" alt=\"img_1202\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jocsescolarsesportiusprimerajornada17/img_1203.jpg\" alt=\"img_1203\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jocsescolarsesportiusprimerajornada17/img_12